   "source": [
    "# Machine Learning Capstone (23CSE301) — Clustering Track\n",
    "## Machine Health Profiling: discovering hydraulic system health states without labels\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dataset:** [UCI Condition Monitoring of Hydraulic Systems](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/447/condition+monitoring+of+hydraulic+systems) (Helwig, Pignanelli & Schütze, 2015): 2,205 load cycles of 60 s each, 17 sensors.\n",
    "**Algorithms:** K-Means, Agglomerative Hierarchical Clustering\n",
    "**Review 2 scope:** Rubric Section B — B1 implementation, B2 metrics + Elbow + Dendrogram, B3 PCA + t-SNE\n",
    "\n",
    "**Story link:** the classification track predicts *whether* a machine will fail; this track discovers *which health states* a machine passes through, with no labels used during fitting.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Outline\n",
    "1. Setup\n",
    "2. Data loading & audit\n",
    "3. Feature extraction\n",
    "4. EDA (light)\n",
    "5. Preprocessing\n",
    "6. K-Means\n",
    "7. Agglomerative clustering\n",
    "8. Metric comparison\n",
    "9. Cluster visualisation (PCA, t-SNE)\n",
    "10. Post-hoc validation against recorded component conditions\n",
    "11. Save models for the app\n",
    "12. Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5fb2a9b1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
