    "## 2. Data loading & audit\n",
    "The data comes as **one tab-separated file per sensor**. Each row is one 60-second load cycle and each column is one time step. Sensors are sampled at different rates (1, 10 or 100 Hz), so the files have different widths.\n",
    "\n",
    "`profile.txt` records the true condition of four components in every cycle. Following guideline 3.3, it is **used only after clustering to interpret results — never as model input.**"
   ]
