   "source": [
    "**Component condition codes** (from `documentation.txt`):\n",
    "\n",
    "| Column | Values | Meaning |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| `cooler_pct` | 3 / 20 / 100 | close to total failure / reduced efficiency / full efficiency |\n",
    "| `valve_pct` | 100 / 90 / 80 / 73 | optimal / small lag / severe lag / close to total failure |\n",
    "| `pump_leakage` | 0 / 1 / 2 | no leakage / weak / severe |\n",
    "| `accumulator_bar` | 130 / 115 / 100 / 90 | optimal pressure / slightly reduced / severely reduced / close to total failure |\n",
    "| `stable_flag` | 0 / 1 | conditions were stable / static conditions might not have been reached yet |"
   ]
  },
