   "source": [
    "## 3. Feature extraction\n",
    "Raw signals cannot be clustered directly: one cycle has 43,680 values, and sensors have different lengths. Each cycle is summarised with **four statistics per sensor — mean, standard deviation, minimum and maximum** — giving 17 × 4 = **68 features per cycle** (constant ones are dropped in Section 5).\n",
    "\n",
    "The function below will be reused by the Streamlit app, so an uploaded cycle is transformed exactly as in training."
   ]
