    "## 6. K-Means\n",
    "### 6.1 Choosing k\n",
    "K-Means is fitted for k = 2 to 10. Two views are used to pick k:\n",
    "- **Elbow curve** — inertia (within-cluster sum of squares) vs k; look for the point where adding clusters stops helping much.\n",
    "- **Silhouette vs k** — how well separated the clusters are (higher is better)."
   ]
