   "source": [
    "## 11. Save models for the app\n",
    "The app cannot use Agglomerative clustering for new cycles: `AgglomerativeClustering` has no `predict()` method. So the app uses K-Means. One file is saved containing everything the app needs:\n",
    "- `pipeline` — the fitted `StandardScaler` → `KMeans`\n",
    "- `pca` — the fitted PCA, to place a new cycle on the plot\n",
    "- `feature_names`, `sensors` — so uploaded data is checked and ordered the same way\n",
    "- `cluster_names` — the plain-language names above"
   ]
  },
